<%# console.about — DEV-009: the rebuild's own content, NOT WordPress the project. -%>
<% @page_title = "About" %>
<h1 class="wp-heading-inline">About</h1>
<hr class="wp-header-end">
<%= render "console/info/nav" %>
<p>This administration console is a Rails 8.1 / PostgreSQL rebuild of a WordPress
7.2-alpha site, produced by the Reversa migration. The public site renders byte-for-byte
from PostgreSQL; the console is modernized (rails-hotwire) — a semantic reproduction of
the legacy screens, with every functional string carried over verbatim and the panel
markup rebuilt.</p>
<p>What the rebuild deliberately does NOT carry: the hook/filter system (AD-01), the plugin
architecture (DEV-011), admin colour schemes (DEV-005) and WordPress&#8217;s own
project-authored marketing copy (DEV-009).</p>
